Upon notice, a compliance affidavit dated 29.08.2022 has been filed by the Collector, Balangir,
wherein paragraphs 3, 4 and 6 read as under:
// 2 // "3. That, the opposite parties have immensely high regards for the Hon'ble High Court and submit to your Honour's order as a privilege and great sense of duty and we have been working to observe the order passed in the W.P.(C) No.27334 of 2020 in letters and spirit at the earliest.
